	"christRedeemerTitle": "Hey there! I’m Lalit Sahu, and I’m glad you’re here.",
	"christRedeemerSubTitle": "Welcome",
	"christRedeemerRegionTitle": "I'm from Indore",
	"christRedeemerArtifactGeolocation": "Brazil",
	"christRedeemerPullQuote1Top": "A Perfect Union Between",
	"christRedeemerPullQuote1Bottom": "Nature and Architecture",
	"christRedeemerPullQuote2": "The statue looms large on the landscape, but it hides as much as it reveals about the diverse religious life of Brazilians.",
	"christRedeemerPullQuote2Author": "Thomas Tweed",
	"christRedeemerCallout1": "The statue of Christ the Redeemer with open arms, a symbol of peace, was chosen.",
	"christRedeemerCallout2": "The Notary App, Application Developer, Bengaluru, India (Jul. 2024 - Oct. 2024)",
	"christRedeemerVideoCaption": "“The Majestic Statue of Christ the Redeemer - Seven Wonders of the Modern World - See U in History.” Youtube, uploaded by See U in History / Mythology.",
	"christRedeemerMapCaption": "Map showing location of Christ the Redeemer in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil.",
	"christRedeemerHistoryInfo1": "Hello! I’m Lalit Sahu, a passionate and driven software developer specializing in cross-platform application development and cybersecurity. Currently pursuing an Integrated MTech at Vellore Institute of Technology, Bhopal, I maintain a strong academic record with a CGPA of 8.68, and I am deeply committed to expanding my expertise in cutting-edge technologies. \nWith hands-on experience as an Application Developer at TheNotaryApp, I excel in creating user-centric applications, optimizing performance, and ensuring seamless integration with back-end services. My projects, such as EventEaze and Cultural Repository, demonstrate my proficiency in Flutter, Dart, and Firebase, showcasing my ability to deliver scalable, innovative solutions to complex problems. \nBeyond academics and professional engagements, I actively solve challenging problems on Leetcode (Top 50,000 globally) and GeeksForGeeks, with over 1,200 problems solved collectively. My contributions to open-source projects through GirlScript Summer of Code 2024 reflect my collaborative spirit and commitment to the tech community. \nI have been fortunate to receive numerous accolades, including a 100% scholarship under the STARS SCHEME and recognition for academic excellence through prestigious awards like the INSPIRE Award. With certifications in Postman API, SQL, and Networking, I continuously strive to enhance my technical skill set. \nPassionate about technology, learning, and innovation, I am eager to tackle real-world challenges and contribute to impactful projects. Let’s connect to explore opportunities to build something incredible together! 🚀",
	"christRedeemerHistoryInfo2": "The Catholic Circle of Rio made a second proposal for a landmark statue on the mountain in 1920. The group organized an event called Semana do Monumento (\"Monument Week\") to attract donations and collect signatures to support the building of the statue. The organization was motivated by what they perceived as \"Godlessness\" in the society.\nThe designs considered for the \"Statue of the Christ\" included a representation of the Christian cross, a statue of Jesus with a globe in his hands, and a pedestal symbolizing the world.",
	"christRedeemerConstructionInfo1": "Artist Carlos Oswald and local engineer Heitor da Silva Costa designed the statue. French sculptor Paul Landowski created the work. In 1922, Landowski commissioned fellow Parisian Romanian sculptor Gheorghe Leonida, who studied sculpture at the Fine Arts Conservatory in Bucharest and in Italy.",
	"christRedeemerConstructionInfo2": "• Designed and maintained cross-platform application development using Flutter and Dart, prioritizing feature enhancements, user-friendly UI/UX, and seamless integration with RESTful APIs.\n• Implemented Git and GitLab for effective version control, facilitating smooth collaboration across development teams.\n• Successfully deployed mobile applications to Google Play Store, overseeing release cycles, resulting in a 5-10% performance improvement and a 10-15% reduction in app size.\n• Conducted API testing with Postman, ensuring seamless communication between front-end and back-end services.",
	"christRedeemerLocationInfo1": "Corcovado, which means \"hunchback\" in Portuguese, is a mountain in central Rio de Janeiro, Brazil. It is a 2,329 foot (710 m) granite peak located in the Tijuca Forest, a national park.",
	"christRedeemerLocationInfo2": "Corcovado hill lies just west of the city center but is wholly within the city limits and visible from great distances.",
	"christRedeemer1850ce": "🎓 Integrated M.Tech in Cyber Security \n🏫 Vellore Institute of Technology, Bhopal \n📊 CGPA: 8.68/10 \n(Year of completion: e.g., 2026)",
	"christRedeemer1921ce": "🎓 Class 12th \n🏫 Government Excellence H.S. School, Guna \n📈 Percentage: 96% \n(Year completed: 2021)",
	"christRedeemer1922ce": "🎓 Class 10th \n🏫 Government Excellence H.S. School, Guna \n📉 Percentage: 95.8% \n(Year completed: 2019)",
	"christRedeemer1926ce": "Construction officially began after the initial design was chosen via a competition and amended by Brazilian artists and engineers.",
	"christRedeemer1931ce": "Construction of the statue was completed, standing 98’ tall with a 92’ wide arm span.",
	"christRedeemer2006ce": "A chapel was consecrated at the statue’s base to Our Lady of Aparecida to mark the statue’s 75th anniversary.",
